# Forms

> Purpose: every form uses one customized, unified Tailwind-styled system. No bare browser defaults.

## Rules

### Controls
| Control | Requirement |
|---------|-------------|
| Label | Tied to control; `text-sm font-medium`; consistent required marker |
| Text / textbox | Shared height token, radius, border, focus ring |
| Email · Tel | Same chrome + format validation UX (tel: optional shared formatting) |
| Password | **Show/hide** toggle; same chrome as text |
| Search | Clear action when a value is present |
| Select | Custom select matching input metrics |
| Checkbox | Custom box + full label hit target |
| Radio | Custom group; one selection; keyboard navigable |
| Slider | Range styled to theme; min/max/step; optional value label |
| Picker | Date/time/datetime with input tokens — full spec (calendar, time, range) in `ui-components.mdc` |
| Stepper | − / value / +, with min/max/step |
| Editor | Multiline / rich text — shared border, focus, error |
| Upload | Preview, remove, type/size errors; progress + retry; multiple files *(when the concept needs it)* |
| Button | Primary / secondary / ghost / danger; text · icon · icon+text |
| Link `a` | Brand tokens; not default blue |

### Chrome
- One token set: height, radius, border, focus ring, error, success, disabled, placeholder
- Error text `text-sm text-danger` below the field; `aria-invalid` + `aria-describedby`
- Keyboard and screen-reader accessible; icon-only buttons need `aria-label`
- Build controls once in `components/ui/`; compose fields from them (no page-specific form forks)

### Patterns (when the concept needs them)
- **Wizard:** preserve values across steps, validate per step, show progress
- **Dependent fields:** show/hide/enable inside the shared system
- **Async validation** (e.g. username taken): pending/error/success states from tokens, debounced
- **Long forms:** sticky actions without breaking mobile tap targets

## Do not
- Mix native unstyled inputs with custom chrome in one form
- Use one-off heights or colors outside the theme
